      Performs a clean build if board exists.

  zephyrproject -install-completion
      Installs bash tab auto-completion for this script.

  zephyrproject -delete "project-name"
      Deletes the specified project from the Applications folder.

  zephyrproject -show
      Lists projects in the Applications directory.

  zephyrproject -build
      Performs a normal build.

  zephyrproject -clean
      Performs a pristine build.

  zephyrproject -flash
      Builds and flashes to the board.

  zephyrproject -clean-flash
      Performs pristine build and flashes to the board.

  zephyrproject -flash-only
      Flashes existing build output.

  zephyrproject -debug
      Builds and starts GDB debug.

  zephyrproject -debugserver
      Builds and starts OpenOCD GDB server.

